                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "11060017-589b-3c53-99ee-f994a9b97650",
                        "entry_id": "371b3c11-39dc-3f83-8f8a-6c097abef5d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "в феодальном обществе — крупный землевладелец-феодал, власть которого основана на вассальном подчинении ему более мелких феодалов, получавших от сюзерена право на часть земли (феод) в его владениях"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "893c3d78-fc46-3847-865f-c93e616fdf5b",
                        "entry_id": "371b3c11-39dc-3f83-8f8a-6c097abef5d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "государство, по отношению к которому другое государство находится в вассальной зависимости"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d1948758-4047-485d-874d-8bf76a2c5842",
                        "source_entry_id": "371b3c11-39dc-3f83-8f8a-6c097abef5d3",
                        "target_lang_word": "suzerain",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "suzerain",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2fe5ef4d-95f8-3fbc-a3a8-f69d8b481c81",
                                        "entry_id": "bb71ea78-4649-3a14-af3a-7e3eb7a540af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dominant nation or state that has control over the international affairs of a subservient state which otherwise has domestic autonomy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ab5ca21-df44-4c84-afda-25ce5908052e",
                                                "sense_id": "2fe5ef4d-95f8-3fbc-a3a8-f69d8b481c81",
                                                "text": "Suzerainty is a term which was originally used for the relation between the feudal lord and his vassal; the lord was said to be the suzerain of the vassal, and at that time suzerainty was a term of Constitutional Law only. With the disappearance of the feudal system, suzerainty of this kind likewise disappeared. Modern suzerainty involves only a few rights of the suzerain State over the vassal State which can be called constitutional rights. The rights of the suzerain State over the vassal are principally international rights, of whatever they may consist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d14eebb-771b-46fd-849d-b5aa2740dc9a",
                                                "sense_id": "2fe5ef4d-95f8-3fbc-a3a8-f69d8b481c81",
                                                "text": "The origin of these conflicts is to be sought in the position which Rome acquired about 275 b.c. as suzerain and protector of all Italy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e6bc4bf-e45a-376c-8d75-71906d07fbfa",
                                        "entry_id": "bb71ea78-4649-3a14-af3a-7e3eb7a540af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A feudal landowner to whom vassals were forced to pledge allegiance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "918cd147-7a17-4d2b-8820-20023db54abe",
                        "source_entry_id": "371b3c11-39dc-3f83-8f8a-6c097abef5d3",
                        "target_lang_word": "overlord",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "overlord",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "165df810-f2b4-361b-986a-6ac2015ce769",
                                        "entry_id": "b986ae7c-a371-373e-8bd6-f673987dd4c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A ruler of other rulers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bf1eb31-f591-4283-a973-6c411b806d5b",
                                                "sense_id": "165df810-f2b4-361b-986a-6ac2015ce769",
                                                "text": "The various tribal chieftains met each spring to elect an overlord that would lead them in time of war."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41bc6b7f-3232-46cf-a362-4a62aa15982e",
                                                "sense_id": "165df810-f2b4-361b-986a-6ac2015ce769",
                                                "text": "The leader is the man who knows the way of the overlords but identifies with the life of the oppressed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62840cbd-43ec-4501-ac81-088b887fdd1d",
                                                "sense_id": "165df810-f2b4-361b-986a-6ac2015ce769",
                                                "text": "Warlords leveraged their veteran soldiers to seize living space while the Council races were still grateful. Over centuries, the krogan conquered world after world. There was always \"just one more\" needed. When the Council finally demanded withdrawal from the asari colony of Lusia, krogan Overlord Kredak stormed off the Citadel, daring the Council to take their worlds back."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44491aaa-404a-31dd-b22d-2f6bb6c5492e",
                                        "entry_id": "b986ae7c-a371-373e-8bd6-f673987dd4c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A feudal lord directly owed rent or personal service by a tenant of subinfeudated land, a tenant's liege lord."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f97264c9-d79c-4775-bbdf-8422de0222ca",
                                                "sense_id": "44491aaa-404a-31dd-b22d-2f6bb6c5492e",
                                                "text": "The tenant owed a variety of obligations to his overlord—usually including military service or serjeanty—but these were gradually converted into monetary rents."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55bbbea8-832c-3a0b-a3c7-9dccacdd08ea",
                                        "entry_id": "b986ae7c-a371-373e-8bd6-f673987dd4c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anyone with overarching power or authority in a given domain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11e1a234-b0ed-41ec-8641-b63f60a0b9e8",
                                                "sense_id": "55bbbea8-832c-3a0b-a3c7-9dccacdd08ea",
                                                "text": "The crusty old professor was overlord of the history department, and few dared to cross his will."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d0bf04e-660c-4b3d-9cdf-24fe692a68b7",
                                                "sense_id": "55bbbea8-832c-3a0b-a3c7-9dccacdd08ea",
                                                "text": "One thing is for certain, there is no stopping them; the ants will soon be here. And I, for one, welcome our new insect overlords."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a781ec0-e4f3-4965-99dc-b4ced82b0b27",
                                                "sense_id": "55bbbea8-832c-3a0b-a3c7-9dccacdd08ea",
                                                "text": "Fluffy is wearing a diamond collar that belongs in the Tower of London with a platoon of Beefeaters standing guard over it. \"I for one welcome our new feline overlords.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d58123c-b870-469c-b382-ca9a7d1d80ba",
                                                "sense_id": "55bbbea8-832c-3a0b-a3c7-9dccacdd08ea",
                                                "text": "“It’s not like young authors need to worry about being supplanted now,” Ms. Williams said. “It’s a worry. But it’s got a ways to go, at least. They haven’t become our overlords yet.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "overlord",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "726a9676-dad0-3c5b-ad4a-f3adfcf9fff4",
                                        "entry_id": "ff832c83-cbb4-32c7-a393-83dd370a4698",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To rule over; to domineer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c8104d2-bde6-4e3e-94ca-38f6e159adc6",
                                                "sense_id": "726a9676-dad0-3c5b-ad4a-f3adfcf9fff4",
                                                "text": "Poor Johnny one-note sang out with gusto / And just overlorded the place"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f0e1c10f-4426-4732-9ec7-6d605bc8df6e",
                        "source_entry_id": "371b3c11-39dc-3f83-8f8a-6c097abef5d3",
                        "target_lang_word": "suzerain",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "suzerain",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "908d4eb2-150c-3e05-aba0-bfc0c872395b",
                                        "entry_id": "b9cc4d05-0805-3ecd-a5f3-a8d129798249",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se dit d’un seigneur possédant un fief dont d’autres fiefs relevaient."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62ea2825-8d6f-4363-b98b-b82b2b38d45d",
                                                "sense_id": "908d4eb2-150c-3e05-aba0-bfc0c872395b",
                                                "text": "Le seigneur suzerain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "805870b4-ba89-333d-9ddb-f78e364e2c79",
                                        "entry_id": "b9cc4d05-0805-3ecd-a5f3-a8d129798249",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui remplit des fonctions de protectorat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58ff9ca4-90bb-4aaa-854e-e1873aa25da3",
                                                "sense_id": "805870b4-ba89-333d-9ddb-f78e364e2c79",
                                                "text": "Dans les pays de protectorat, plus que partout ailleurs, il est rare que les représentants de l’État suzerain, après un séjour prolongé au milieu de la race subjuguée, ne s’affranchissent pas des scrupules de l’honnêteté vulgaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "suzerain",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1b2a3008-6cfc-38ec-9562-94a34e58b154",
                                        "entry_id": "ca7404b5-a790-385d-9d24-5ff87b558495",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif à La Suze-sur-Sarthe, commune française située dans le département de la Sarthe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "suzerain",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "19e196ce-0baa-3027-a0c8-c3469c6838ed",
                                        "entry_id": "2ef56dbd-a253-3548-aa60-103f8da723e6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Seigneur possédant un fief dont d’autres fiefs relèvent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e387468-86db-4d33-810b-ebd83ee35802",
                                                "sense_id": "19e196ce-0baa-3027-a0c8-c3469c6838ed",
                                                "text": "Rambervillers dépendait du temporel de l'évêché de Metz, et les évêques en étaient les suzerains ; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efca399d-46e2-430c-86b1-a3d10e3e5443",
                                                "sense_id": "19e196ce-0baa-3027-a0c8-c3469c6838ed",
                                                "text": "Sur la foi jurée à vos Saintes, sur la fidélité au suzerain, sur la légitimité du roi de France, rapportez-vous-en à nous, disaient-ils."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8bc5be29-56c1-4a9f-ae8b-b1ba7f56ac24",
                                                "sense_id": "19e196ce-0baa-3027-a0c8-c3469c6838ed",
                                                "text": "Le relâchement du lien vassalitique est une des causes de la défaite finale du Midi et de son suzerain, le comte de Toulouse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4caf6349-d772-3cd9-87bd-d82c722f0fd0",
                                        "entry_id": "2ef56dbd-a253-3548-aa60-103f8da723e6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pays qui domine un autre pays, donnant à celui-ci certaines autonomies domestiques."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
